age-2\"><img class=\"hero-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-03.webp\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <h3>MDM<br /><span>(Mobile Device Management)</span></h3>\n                <p>\n                    MDM centrally manages enterprise mobile devices\n                    for security, compliance, and efficiency. The fastgrowing global market (over 12% projected CAGR)\n                    is seeing rising demand from SMEs and sectors like\n                    logistics for tailored, simpler solutions. MDM is\n                    essential for data security, productivity, and\n                    regulatory adherence in enterprise mobility.\n                </p>\n                <a href=\"https://www.ulefone.com/pages/take-control-with-ulefone-mdm\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-learn-more.webp\"></a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"section-hero\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <h3>PoC<br /><span>(Push-to-Talk over Cellular)</span></h3>\n                <p>\n                    Cellular-based PoC offers nationwide instant\n                    multimedia dispatch (voice, video, location,\n                    collaboration) for businesses, overcoming\n                    traditional radio distance limits. It boosts\n                    communication efficiency (e.g., 60% in logistics -\n                    IDC 2024) with low-latency, reliable networks.\n                </p>\n                <a href=\"https://www.ulefone.com/pages/ulefone-professional-poc-communication\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-learn-more.webp\"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-image hero-image-3\"><img class=\"hero-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-04.webp\"></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"section-hero\">\n            <img class=\"hero-img\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-02.webp\">\n            <div class=\"hero-image hero-image-1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <h3>RFID</h3>\n                <p>\n                    RFID intelligent devices enable precise wireless\n                    identification and full data tracking for applications\n                    like warehouse inventory, manufacturing\n                    traceability, retail self-checkout, and healthcare\n                    supply monitoring. Their rapid, robust identification\n                    significantly cuts manual errors (over 90%), driving\n                    digital asset management and boosting operational\n                    transparency in the rapidly growing global RFID\n                    market (over 15% annual growth). This technology\n                    is key to smart supply chain upgrades and supports\n                    your digital transformation.\n                </p>\n                <a href=\"https://www.ulefone.com/pages/ulefone-rfid-reader\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/corporate-busines-learn-more.webp\"></a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </div>\n</div>"
