        "slide_GMnTnG": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/corporate-busines-5.webp",
            "custom_html": "<h2>RFID Reader</h2>\n<p>\n    RFID (Radio-Frequency Identification) uses radio waves for contactless, bulk\n    identification and tracking of tagged items (up to hundreds within meters),\n    unlike manual barcodes. Its speed, accuracy, and data security make it a\n    key technology for digital transformation in the IoT.\n</p>\n<h2>Adaptible Industries Solution</h2>\n<h6>Warehousing &amp; Logistics</h6>\n<p>\n    Rapid, bulk inbound/outbound verification, Dynamic inventory checks on\n    warehouse shelves, Package status tracking during transit\n</p>\n<h6>Retail Stores</h6>\n<p>\n    Self-service inventory and restocking, Fitting room traffic and item\n    association analysis, Anti-counterfeiting traceability and anti-theft alerts\n</p>\n<h6>Smart Manufacturing</h6>\n<p>\n    Monitoring of work-in-progress on production lines, Intelligent tool/mold\n    borrowing and return management\n</p>\n<h6>Healthcare</h6>\n<p>\n    Location tracking and maintenance records for medical equipment,\n    Traceability of surgical instrument sterilization processes\n</p><h6>Asset Management</h6>\n<p>\n    Mobile inspections of fixed assets, Quick borrowing and return registration\n    of meeting materials\n</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_4xybGa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/corporate-busines-6.webp",
            "custom_html": "<h2>MDM (Mobile Device Management)</h2>\n<p>MDM uses software to centrally manage and secure company mobile\n    devices (smartphones, tablets, laptops) for security, compliance, and\n    efficiency. It enables configuration, monitoring, maintenance, and remote\n    operation. Essential for mobile work, MDM balances efficiency, security,\n    and cost across industries and is increasingly vital with remote work and\n    IoT.</p>\n<h2>Adaptible Industries Solution</h2>\n<h6>Office Device Management</h6>\n<p>Manage company phones/tablets to ensure secure access to internal systems.</p>\n<h6>Retail and Service Industries</h6>\n<p>Manage in-store POS terminals and inventory scanners. Deploy apps and updates centrally.</p>\n<h6>Education</h6>\n<p>Manage school-issued tablets. Restrict students from installing games or accessing non-educational websites.</p>\n<h6>Healthcare</h6>\n<p>Ensure doctor tablets comply with HIPAA. Encrypt patient data and log access.</p>\n<h6>Logistics and Transportation</h6>\n<p>Track driver device location to optimize routes; remotely diagnose device issues.</p>\n<h6>Remote/Hybrid Work</h6>\n<p>When employees' personal phones access company email, MDM isolates work data and enforces two-factor authentication.</p>\n<h6>Installment Retail</h6>\n<p>Use MDM to manage regulations and usage restrictions for installment payment products, reducing risk.</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_mgTiGn": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/corporate-busines-7.webp",
            "custom_html": "<h2>POC（Push-to-Talk over Cellular）</h2>\n        <p>PoC (Push-to-Talk over Cellular) is an intelligent trunked communication\n        service based on 4G/5G cellular networks. It overcomes the distance\n        limitations of traditional two-way radios, enabling \"one-touch\" instant\n        communication nationwide and globally. It transmits voice, data, and\n        location information via IP networks, supports multiple terminal access\n        (phones, professional terminals, vehicle devices, etc.), and includes features\n        like group calls, multimedia dispatch, and track playback. It is a nextgeneration, high-efficiency collaborative communication solution for\n        enterprises.</p>\n<h2>Adaptible Industries Solution</h2>\n<h6>Public Safety</h6>\n<h6>Security</h6>\n<h6>Logistics</h6>\n<h6>Transportation</h6>\n<h6>Mining</h6>\n<h6>Commercial</h6>\n<h6>Healthcare</h6>"
          }
        }
      },
